  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Omit Filename attribute when saving snippets to file by @csessh and @RamiAwar  in https://github.com/knqyf263/pet/pull/328 🔥 \r\n* README improvements by @alxgu in https://github.com/knqyf263/pet/pull/331\r\n* Updated goreleaser gh action by @RamiAwar in https://github.com/knqyf263/pet/pull/332\r\n* Filter snippets by tag -> pet list -t $tag #329 by @a2xdeveloper and @RamiAwar in https://github.com/knqyf263/pet/pull/334 🥳 \r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @a2xdeveloper made their first contribution in https://github.com/knqyf263/pet/pull/334 Thank you!\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/knqyf263/pet/compare/v1.0.0...v1.0.1",
